{"seq":4,"slug":"mixed-precision","title":"混合精度训练","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/training-at-scale/mixed-precision","wordCount":1110,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"混合精度训练\">混合精度训练</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>混合精度训练（Mixed Precision Training）通过在训练中同时使用不同的数值精度（如 FP16/BF16 和 FP32）来加速计算并降低显存占用，同时保持与全精度训练相当的模型质量。核心思想是：大部分前向和反向计算使用低精度（速度快、显存省），而参数更新和关键累积操作使用高精度（保持数值稳定性）。现代 GPU（如 NVIDIA A100/H100）的 Tensor Core 对低精度运算有硬件级加速，混合精度可以带来 2-3 倍的训练加速。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;FP32 主参数&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;转换为 FP16/BF16&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;FP16 前向传播&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;FP16 损失计算&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;损失缩放&lt;br/&gt;Loss × Scale&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;FP16 反向传播&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;FP32 梯度更新&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; A\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"FP32 主参数\"] --&gt; B[\"转换为 FP16/BF16\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"FP16 前向传播\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"FP16 损失计算\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"损失缩放&lt;br/&gt;Loss × Scale\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"FP16 反向传播\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"FP32 梯度更新\"]\n    G --&gt; A</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数值格式</th>\n<th>位数</th>\n<th>指数位</th>\n<th>尾数位</th>\n<th>数值范围</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FP32</td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>23</td>\n<td>±3.4×10³⁸</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>参数存储、梯度累积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FP16</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>±6.5×10⁴</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>矩阵乘法、卷积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BF16</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>±3.4×10³⁸</td>\n<td>较低</td>\n<td>大模型训练</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TF32</td>\n<td>19</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>±3.4×10³⁸</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>A100 默认模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FP8 (E4M3)</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>±448</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>H100 推理/训练</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"fp16-训练与损失缩放\">FP16 训练与损失缩放</h2><p>FP16 的主要挑战是其有限的数值范围。FP16 能表示的最小正数约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6 \\times 10^{-8}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，而训练中的梯度值经常小于这个阈值，导致下溢为零。损失缩放（Loss Scaling）通过在反向传播前将损失乘以一个大的缩放因子来解决这个问题。</p>\n<p><strong>静态损失缩放</strong>使用固定的缩放因子（如 1024），简单但需要人工调节。</p>\n<p><strong>动态损失缩放</strong>自动调整缩放因子：如果梯度中出现 Inf/NaN，说明缩放过大，将缩放因子减半并跳过这步更新；如果连续多步正常，则增大缩放因子。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;from torch.cuda.amp import autocast, GradScaler&#10;&#10;model = MyModel().cuda()&#10;optimizer = torch.optim.AdamW(model.parameters(), lr=1e-3)&#10;scaler = GradScaler()&#10;&#10;for batch in dataloader:&#10;    optimizer.zero_grad()&#10;    with autocast(dtype=torch.float16):&#10;        output = model(batch)&#10;        loss = criterion(output, target)&#10;    scaler.scale(loss).backward()&#10;    scaler.unscale_(optimizer)&#10;    torch.nn.utils.clip_grad_norm_(model.parameters(), max_norm=1.0)&#10;    scaler.step(optimizer)&#10;    scaler.update()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.cuda.amp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> autocast, GradScaler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MyModel().cuda()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">optimizer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.optim.AdamW(model.parameters(), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">lr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1e-3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scaler </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GradScaler()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dataloader:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    optimizer.zero_grad()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> autocast(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dtype</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">torch.float16):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        output </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model(batch)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> criterion(output, target)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    scaler.scale(loss).backward()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    scaler.unscale_(optimizer)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    torch.nn.utils.clip_grad_norm_(model.parameters(), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max_norm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    scaler.step(optimizer)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    scaler.update()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>PyTorch 的 <code>autocast</code> 上下文管理器自动为不同操作选择最优精度：矩阵乘法和卷积使用 FP16（Tensor Core 加速），归一化和 Softmax 保持 FP32（数值敏感）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"bf16-与大模型训练\">BF16 与大模型训练</h2><p>BF16（Brain Float 16）与 FP32 共享相同的 8 位指数，因此数值范围与 FP32 一致，不需要损失缩放。但 BF16 的尾数只有 7 位（FP16 有 10 位），精度更低。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"with autocast(dtype=torch.bfloat16):&#10;    output = model(batch)&#10;    loss = criterion(output, target)&#10;&#10;loss.backward()&#10;optimizer.step()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> autocast(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dtype</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">torch.bfloat16):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    output </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model(batch)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> criterion(output, target)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">loss.backward()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">optimizer.step()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>BF16 的最大优势是简化了训练流程——不需要 GradScaler 和损失缩放，不会出现梯度溢出。这使得 BF16 成为大语言模型训练的首选格式。GPT-3、LLaMA、PaLM 等大模型都使用 BF16 训练。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 精度选择决策&#10;        A{GPU 类型} --&gt; |A100/H100| B{模型规模}&#10;        A --&gt; |V100| C[&quot;FP16 + 损失缩放&quot;]&#10;        B --&gt; |大模型| D[&quot;BF16&lt;br/&gt;无需损失缩放&quot;]&#10;        B --&gt; |中小模型| E[&quot;FP16 + AMP&lt;br/&gt;效率最高&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 精度选择决策\n        A{GPU 类型} --&gt; |A100/H100| B{模型规模}\n        A --&gt; |V100| C[\"FP16 + 损失缩放\"]\n        B --&gt; |大模型| D[\"BF16&lt;br/&gt;无需损失缩放\"]\n        B --&gt; |中小模型| E[\"FP16 + AMP&lt;br/&gt;效率最高\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>FP16 + AMP</th>\n<th>BF16</th>\n<th>FP32</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>训练速度</td>\n<td>快（2-3x）</td>\n<td>快（2x）</td>\n<td>基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>显存占用</td>\n<td>减半</td>\n<td>减半</td>\n<td>基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要损失缩放</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数值稳定性</td>\n<td>需小心</td>\n<td>较好</td>\n<td>最好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硬件要求</td>\n<td>Volta+</td>\n<td>Ampere+</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型应用</td>\n<td>CNN、中等模型</td>\n<td>大语言模型</td>\n<td>精度敏感任务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"量化感知训练\">量化感知训练</h2><p>量化感知训练（Quantization-Aware Training, QAT）在训练过程中模拟量化效果，使模型学会适应低精度表示，从而在推理时直接使用 INT8 或更低精度而不损失精度。</p>\n<p>QAT 在前向传播中插入伪量化节点（fake quantization），将浮点值映射到整数再映射回浮点。反向传播使用直通估计器（Straight-Through Estimator, STE）绕过不可导的量化操作。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch.quantization as quant&#10;&#10;model.train()&#10;model.qconfig = quant.get_default_qat_qconfig(&#39;x86&#39;)&#10;model_prepared = quant.prepare_qat(model)&#10;&#10;for batch in dataloader:&#10;    output = model_prepared(batch)&#10;    loss = criterion(output, target)&#10;    loss.backward()&#10;    optimizer.step()&#10;&#10;model_quantized = quant.convert(model_prepared)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.quantization </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quant</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model.train()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model.qconfig </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quant.get_default_qat_qconfig(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'x86'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model_prepared </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quant.prepare_qat(model)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dataloader:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    output </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model_prepared(batch)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> criterion(output, target)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    loss.backward()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    optimizer.step()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model_quantized </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quant.convert(model_prepared)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>量化方式</th>\n<th>训练参与</th>\n<th>精度损失</th>\n<th>实现复杂度</th>\n<th>推理加速</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>训练后量化 (PTQ)</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>2-4x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>量化感知训练 (QAT)</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>极小</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>2-4x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态量化</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>1.5-2x</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工程最佳实践\">工程最佳实践</h2><p>混合精度训练的工程实践需要注意几个关键点：</p>\n<p><strong>精度敏感操作</strong>：Softmax、Layer Norm、损失函数中的对数运算应保持 FP32。PyTorch 的 autocast 已经内置了这些规则。</p>\n<p><strong>梯度累积</strong>：在混合精度下做梯度累积时，梯度应在 FP32 下累积，只在最终更新前转换精度。</p>\n<p><strong>分布式训练</strong>：AllReduce 通信中的梯度应使用 FP16/BF16 以减少通信量，但在本地进行 FP32 累积。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"for i, batch in enumerate(dataloader):&#10;    with autocast(dtype=torch.bfloat16):&#10;        loss = model(batch) / accumulation_steps&#10;    loss.backward()&#10;    if (i + 1) % accumulation_steps == 0:&#10;        torch.nn.utils.clip_grad_norm_(model.parameters(), 1.0)&#10;        optimizer.step()&#10;        optimizer.zero_grad()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i, batch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> enumerate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(dataloader):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> autocast(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dtype</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">torch.bfloat16):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model(batch) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accumulation_steps</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    loss.backward()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accumulation_steps </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        torch.nn.utils.clip_grad_norm_(model.parameters(), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        optimizer.step()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        optimizer.zero_grad()</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((混合精度训练))&#10;    数值格式&#10;      FP32 主权重&#10;      FP16 计算&#10;      BF16 大模型&#10;    关键技术&#10;      损失缩放&#10;      AutoCast&#10;      GradScaler&#10;    量化训练&#10;      QAT&#10;      伪量化&#10;      STE&#10;    工程实践&#10;      精度敏感操作&#10;      梯度累积&#10;      分布式通信\">mindmap\n  root((混合精度训练))\n    数值格式\n      FP32 主权重\n      FP16 计算\n      BF16 大模型\n    关键技术\n      损失缩放\n      AutoCast\n      GradScaler\n    量化训练\n      QAT\n      伪量化\n      STE\n    工程实践\n      精度敏感操作\n      梯度累积\n      分布式通信</pre><ul>\n<li>混合精度通过低精度计算 + 高精度存储实现加速与稳定性的平衡</li>\n<li>FP16 训练需要损失缩放防止梯度下溢，BF16 因范围与 FP32 一致无需缩放</li>\n<li>BF16 是大语言模型训练的首选格式，简化了训练流程</li>\n<li>PyTorch 的 autocast 和 GradScaler 提供了开箱即用的混合精度支持</li>\n<li>量化感知训练让模型在训练中适应低精度，推理时可直接使用 INT8</li>\n<li>混合精度是现代深度学习训练的标配，几乎没有理由不使用</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"混合精度训练","id":"混合精度训练"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"FP16 训练与损失缩放","id":"fp16-训练与损失缩放"},{"level":2,"text":"BF16 与大模型训练","id":"bf16-与大模型训练"},{"level":2,"text":"量化感知训练","id":"量化感知训练"},{"level":2,"text":"工程最佳实践","id":"工程最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分布式训练","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/training-at-scale/distributed-training"},"next":{"title":"生成式架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/architectures-and-trends/generative-architectures"}}